  "title": "Grandmother&#39;s Matrimonial Squares",
  "description": "Matrimonial bars, with an oat crust, a filling of cooked dates, and a crunchy oat top layer, are an easy-to-make traditional dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Ceccilia Keen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:13:03-05:00",
